{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ものすごい雪の中、\n来てくださったたくさんの皆様ありがとうございました(´；ω；`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手するとみんなみんな手が冷たくて 中にはあの寒空のなか会場に入りきれなくて3時間近くも待ってたなんて方もいて...\nどんな天候でも会いに来てくださる皆様には感謝の気持ちでいっぱいです(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"１日目全国握手会のペアは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久々にボブになった中田花奈氏"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2017/01/16/5283645/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うなじがお美しいからボブがとても似合うこと^ ^ 羨ましい。\nあみも大きなイメチェン一発してやりたいけどショートはあまり似合わないからなぁ〜。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かなファンの皆様、能條ファンの皆様\nありがとうございました❤️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2日目 個別握手会"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この日も朝から雪がすごくて\n新幹線1時間遅延とか交通機関乱れていたにもかかわらずみんな足を運んで来てくださいました(>_<)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いとありがたき。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2017/01/16/5283645/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"トップス...OUTRO SOL"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スカート...OUTRO SOL"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2017/01/16/5283645/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑\n髪やら口やらについてる白の物体は雪です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この日の話題は、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・新年の抱負"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・武道館"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・乃木團"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・能條牧場"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・バースデーライブ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・のじょラップ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・輪入道さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・まいちゅんのモノマネ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・最近モバメ急激増えたどうした"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"などなどと言った感じですかね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう握手会に来てくれたファンの方には言ったんだけど\n今年からモバメをたくさん送ることに決めたの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちまたで有名な三日坊主だから、決め事というかちゃんとやる事を一つ決めたの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"22歳の能條は ちょっと違うぞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふっふっふっふ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいちゅんのモノマネは握手会でやってって言われることよくあるんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや無理だよ？\n机が邪魔で足上げれないから。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そこらへんご理解よろしくね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと能條牧場に入りたいんですけどって方たくさんいたけど\n能條牧場は能條をそこそこリスペクトしてくれてたら誰でも入れます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"けどはたして能條牧場に入ったら何をするのか どんな活動をするのか...\nそれは私にもよくわかりません。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2017/01/16/5283645/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"蟹"}],"source":"archive"}